# Credentials (NEVER COMMIT). Secret-name-specific on purpose: the old blanket
# *.json ignore silently swallowed every new JSON file (configs, manifests) and
# needed a hand-maintained whitelist. The Secret Scan CI gate covers the rest.
.env
.env.local
credentials.json
client_secrets.json
client_secret*.json
token.pickle
*.pem

